#: app/Support/Privacy.php:177
msgid "Personal Data Collected by Tourivo"
msgstr ""

#: app/Support/Privacy.php:178
msgid "When travelers book a tour or submit a trip inquiry through Tourivo, we collect the following personal information: customer name, email address, phone number, billing address, and special customer requests. If IP address collection is enabled, IP addresses are logged alongside bookings for fraud detection and security auditing."
msgstr ""

#: app/Support/Privacy.php:180
msgid "Purpose of Data Processing"
msgstr ""

#: app/Support/Privacy.php:181
msgid "Personal data is collected strictly to process travel reservations, coordinate room and tour availability, verify customer identity for booking lookups, generate booking vouchers and invoices, and deliver booking confirmation and reminder emails."
msgstr ""

#: app/Support/Privacy.php:183
msgid "Data Retention & Anonymization"
msgstr ""

#: app/Support/Privacy.php:184
msgid "Booking financial records (order totals, taxes, and line items) are retained for statutory accounting. When an erasure request is executed or retention schedules expire, personal identifiers (name, email, phone, billing address, notes, payment references, and IP address) are permanently erased, and voucher links are revoked."
msgstr ""

#: app/Support/Privacy.php:186
msgid "Cookies & Local Browser Storage"
msgstr ""

#: app/Support/Privacy.php:187
msgid "Tourivo utilizes browser local storage (localStorage) exclusively for client-side user experience enhancements, including favorite wishlist tours and selected currency preferences. No sensitive personal information is stored in client cookies."
msgstr ""

#: app/Support/Privacy.php:189
msgid "Security & Rate Limiting"
msgstr ""

#: app/Support/Privacy.php:190
msgid "To protect our booking endpoints against spam, automated abuse, and brute-force attempts, Tourivo stores transient cryptographic hash representations of client IP addresses. These security transients expire automatically within short windows (10 minutes)."
msgstr ""

#: app/Support/Privacy.php:196
msgid "External Webhook Automations"
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: webhook endpoint domain
#: app/Support/Privacy.php:199
#, php-format
msgid "This site is configured to transmit booking and inquiry event payloads to an external automated endpoint (%1$s) via secure HTTPS webhooks for third-party CRM and calendar synchronization."
msgstr ""

